pt telling me not to overwork myself, and to take it easy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_7","text":"But lately, no one says that anymore. It feels much more comfortable now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_8","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_8","text":"That's good to hear.","jump":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_10","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_9","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_9","text":"Or maybe they just gave up because you never listen?","jump":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_10","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_10","text":"Hehe, maybe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_11","text":"But someone always leaves vitamins and snacks on my desk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_12","text":"So in a way...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_13","text":"It feels like they're looking out for me even more now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_14","text":"And that's all thanks to you, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_15","text":"No, it just means they appreciate your hard work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_16","text":"Hehe, thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_17","text":"I want to do even better.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce005_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_18","text":"I want to save as many Nikke as I can.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce005_03_05_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce005_03_05_19","text":"I'll be cheering you on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affini